    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d195">

                <pb facs="0282" n="178" sameAs="frus:frus1913/pg178"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 893.51/1369.</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The American Group to the
                            Secretary of State.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">New York</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1913-04-02">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">April 2, 1913</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>
                    <hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: We beg to enclose herewith, for your
                    information, copy of the telegram which we have received today from Messrs.
                    Morgan, Grenfell &amp; Co., in response to our telegram announcing our
                    withdrawal from the negotiations for the reorganization loan, copy of which
                    telegram was transmitted to you with our letter of March 19th. We also beg to
                    enclose copy of our reply to Messrs. Morgan, Grenfell &amp; Company’s telegram
                    of today’s date, together with a copy of the telegram which we have received
                    from Peking in response to our message, copy of which was yesterday forwarded to
                    the Department.</p>
                <p>Very truly yours,</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Willard Straight</hi>.</signed>
                </closer>





